Game asset for a 2D animation rig, matching the eyes of this fox character Charlie (3D clay cartoon style).
Draw ONLY the iris of one eye, seen straight on: a perfect circle filling about 90% of the canvas, centered.
A deep glossy dark brown iris that gets warmer and lighter brown toward the bottom, a large soft black pupil in the middle, subtle radial fibres, one big soft white specular highlight at the upper right and one small highlight at the lower left, like a polished glass marble.
No eyelids, no eye white, no lashes, no skin, no outline. Fully transparent background.
